{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-05-24 02:30:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES AND VISTA BRING LUXSTREAM UNLIMITED DATA PLAN TO CUSTOMERS', 'text': "GENEVA , MAY 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES' (NYSE: RTX) COLLINS AEROSPACE BUSINESS\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS PLAN TO BRING UNLIMITED DATA TO THE CUSTOMERS OF VISTA, A LEADING PRIVATE AVIATION GROUP. USING COLLINS' LUXSTREAM, WHICH RUNS EXCLUSIVELY ON THE SES'S HIGH-THROUGHPUT SATELLITE (HTS) NETWORK, VISTA CUSTOMERS CAN NOW ENJOY FAST, RELIABLE, UNLIMITED INTERNET ACCESS FOR THE DURATION OF THEIR FLIGHTS."}